{"id":"3cdfb6932a1bb4ab","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Cluster Point","display":"df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point — ZFC Filter7 Cluster Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point — ZFC Filter7 Cluster Point","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point — ZFC Filter7 Cluster Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x\\in V,\\ x\\in X\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x\\in V,\\ x\\in X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ClusterPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ClusterPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}cluster\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ClusterPoint}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(U\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}cluster\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ClusterPoint}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(U\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A cluster point is met by every filter member inside every neighbourhood; the ambient topology and proper-filter axioms are part of the predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x\\in V,\\ x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ClusterPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}cluster\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ClusterPoint}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\land x\\in X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(U\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1243,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1912","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-cluster-point]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e7514bc4cefba4f2","d1121e6ff027ff98"]}